===Professional dancers===
{{See also|List of Strictly Come Dancing contestants{{!}}List of ''Strictly Come Dancing'' contestants}}
Each series, celebrities are paired with professional dance partners who instruct them in the various dance styles, design their choreography, and perform with them each week in the competition. For the eighth series, the show introduced the Strictly Showdancers, a dance troupe which consisted of professional dancers who performed on the show but were not paired with celebrity partners. This did not return in subsequent series.

